Matt and Zico Kolter had a great time chatting with @swyx. They are excited about the projects at @GraySwanAI.

Gray Swan cofounders Zico Kolter and Matt Fredrikson explain why AI security is fundamentally different from traditional cybersecurity. They discuss their automated red-teaming system Shade, which can now outperform humans at breaking frontier models, and how prompt injection creates new exploits for agents like Claude Code and Codex. They warn that the first major AI security breach may be a gray swan event that everyone anticipates.

